{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/tCu1B4BAZdlmUGdQkAED_g","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:45.634182+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/tCu1B4BAZdlmUGdQkAED_g","html":"<div><section><section><section><span>6</span></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xPnVKczjwZJvJOoI5krOac20bPDkCI2tJ6tzBbTdct4LZFjuklndmV7AL7JzrRc2icqkRarSKdS9iabkh38tBrzH91ZTTdtIJia40zwRAqL0T0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xPnVKczjwZK8Nia9iaHsNySWx5QGjoYNcq4TnqE0YoMJ1icGJoXCBFZvBcEmqa7R9tx0QPCK8qa14obXsiaet44x6g3GibvEpVF3JqlmCTm7suw8/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>为进一步加强各高校优秀在校大学生对武汉理工大学</span><span><strong><span>资源与环境工程学院</span></strong></span><span>的了解，激发学生的科研热情，拓宽学生的学术视野，为有志于在武汉理工大学资源与环境工程学院深造的学生提供互动交流和学习的平台，现面向全国2027届应届本科毕业生举办全国优秀大学生夏令营。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>学院简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/xPnVKczjwZLsibL5cWzyj6zmCHOmnMxSMmjYFzsDB9OTictzPyjUd2FIaVicpEW6RSia0mE6UJD676OXlWCWf56pslDV0gFgdS7fN5hz9VnP7Cg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/xPnVKczjwZLBpGvM9Ah8HDjzibD0A7ZoUL9oxz2nCaUQnUdJicf7NnwibA1vfXX7SYSehAVse1jpE96OpKMDKI0zZlOf6DKZO5uy3uTbf3no30/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>资源与环境工程学院（简称“资环学院”）的历史可以追溯至1958年建立的北京建筑工业学院非金属矿系，60多年来，学院坚持社会主义办学方向，贯彻落实党的教育方针，以“建设让人民满意，让世人仰慕的优秀大学”为理想，秉承“育人为本、学术至上”的办学理念，为我国建工建材、资源环境、地理信息、城乡规划等行业及国家社会经济发展做出了积极贡献。</span></span></p><p><span>学院下设</span><strong><span><span>资源开发工程系、矿物加工与材料系、环境科学与工程系、空间信息与规划系</span></span></strong><span>，建有</span><span><span>关键非金属矿产资源绿色利用教育部重点实验室、矿物资源加工与环境湖北省重点实验室、钒资源高效利用湖北省协同创新中心和湖北省资源与环境实验教学示范中心、教育部留学基金委创新型人才国际合作培养平台等多个科研教学平台</span></span><span>。</span><span><strong><span>中国工程院院士余永富教授，任武汉理工大学战略科学家、资源与环境工程学院名誉院长</span></strong></span><span>。</span></p><p><span>学院面向国家重大需求，服务支撑国家重大战略和国家重点研发计划，积极开展基础应用和科学技术研究，近5年取得了较好的学术和科研成果。</span></p><p><span>学院积极践行“立德自强 砥砺求精”的院训精神，围绕学校开展的“新时代领航计划”，坚持以德立人、以智慧人、以体健人、以美化人、以劳塑人的“五育并举”人才培养体系，全面提升学生综合素质，推进导学关系建设。</span></p></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/xPnVKczjwZIeBjFWmRibGtDkFXT7fSfsSaib9ftmjZN0mohicr0c3cIYPZgDndGgicXictEmcfyt9SCYsicWQnXMUv4mHKwWs2GibHO1XWEFwZpXQQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span>资环学院2024年夏令营照片</span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/xPnVKczjwZJatRclys6LhWakiccsSzK1SIia6BG0WicD9AtH9hpibcODgd9piceW3rVEpib7I2za7ibkE8BkMpS2qJiaAibDIicGvA43L9Z1iaMwiaHIpXs/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span>资环学院2025年夏令营照片</span></p></section><section><p><span>具体招生专业及研究方向如下：</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/xPnVKczjwZLx1jvje2vykQbxJ2CEKnCY1ibwYiasJ0H5tdPGA3KLV9xWvxayh9NPaq8yShZdHsnP4jwibua4icjcpoQEokqye9WJst6HuXbb4Lo/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>具体安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.申报时间：即日起</span><span><strong><span>—6月30日</span></strong></span></p><p><span>2.开营时间：</span><span><strong><span>2026年7月8日—9日</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>3.夏令营活动安排</span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xPnVKczjwZIC5jxC39cjY3860Co3olicCFtQ5gGDDQbRLGPgIDq8FxnCvF77TlrtlGaNFnlIBiaqpHL3ibPWJRosGxbhuyZRY3MsZnaCwDXlck/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>注：具体安排以实际通知为准；营员报到后要求全程参加活动。</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span>4.入营名单公示：我院将于学院官网公示入营名单。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.全日制2027届本科毕业生；</span></span></p><p><span>2.拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></p><p><span>3.诚实守信，身心健康，学风端正，无学业学术行为不端记录；</span></p><p><span>4.学习成绩优秀，动手能力强；</span></p><p><span>5.英语水平优秀，第一外国语为英语；</span></p><p><span>6.对所报专业领域的科学研究有浓厚的兴趣，有较强的科研潜力。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>1.网上报名</span></strong></span></p><p><span>本届夏令营活动采取网上报名的方式。凡欲申请本次夏令营的高校优秀学子，请于规定时间在武汉理工大学“夏令营报名系统”</span></p><p><span>（</span><span><strong><span><span>http://whlg.form.360eol.com/enroll/325iTsi4</span></span></strong></span><span><span>）报名并上传“申请资料”附件。未于规定时间在武汉理工大学“夏令营报名系统”报名者，不予受理。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>2.申请资料</span></strong></span></p><p><span>（1）本科成绩单和成绩排名证明（须加盖教务处或院系公章，JPG或PDF格式）；</span></p><p><span>（2）有效居民身份证正反面、学生证（含照片、学号页）、学籍验证报告（从学信网www.chsi.com.cn上在线验证并下载）；</span></p><p><span>（3）个人陈述（800字左右，无格式要求）；</span></p><p><span>（4）个人简历（A4一页，无格式要求）；</span></p><p><span>（5）外语水平证明（英语四、六级考试成绩，托福/雅思成绩或GRE/GMAT成绩等）；</span></p><p><span>（6）其他体现自身学术水平的代表性论文、出版物或原创性工作成果（如有）：</span></p><p><span>①已发表论文证明材料（论文应包括正文第一页（包含作者信息页，并在正文第一页右上角标注本人排名和影响因子））；</span></p><p><span>②本科期间获奖证书或资格证书（校级及以上获奖，不超过5项）。</span></p><p><span>（7）申请人诚信承诺书（见附件）。</span></p><p><span>提示：以上各项材料如有多页，请合并成一个PDF文件，扫描件要求清晰、工整；文件命名格式：姓名—本科院校名称。</span></p><p><span><strong><span>注：以上材料原件将在入营时审核；对弄虚作假、提供不实信息的申请者，不论何时，一经发现查实，将取消其申请资格。</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他说明</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 夏令营期间，我院为营员提供免费餐食并购买人身意外保险。最终被我院拟录取的异地（非武汉市）高校学生（以2026年9-10月份全国研究生推免系统录取结果和2027年硕士研究生招生录取结果为准），报销往返交通费（机票限经济舱、高铁或动车限二等座、火车限硬卧和硬座）及住宿费（请务必留好票据等报销凭证)</span></p><p><span>2. 未尽事宜，欢迎致电</span><span><strong><span>027-87885647</span></strong></span><strong><span><span>（石老师）</span></span></strong><span>咨询。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xPnVKczjwZKXCeKQNLKzJEwpl34amia1KwBNTsDRP7tarbb7E3DBVic1B5hq7Dc0L6tY1e78veh7rVZXr02icKD7bDoum4gW3UiaWAMjobUQVJ4/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span>武理研招·研小芽工作室出品</span></p><p><span>文字、图片 | 资源与环境工程学院</span></p><p><span>设计 | 王昊玥</span></p><p><span>排版 | 刘梦怡</span></p><p><span>责编 | 周小靖</span></p><p><span>审核 | 冯承金</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>往期精选 </span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3Mzg5MDQzMQ==&amp;mid=2247521216&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=0f5895a7045618b1b9a65913b384c7a7&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3Mzg5MDQzMQ==&amp;mid=2247521216&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=0f5895a7045618b1b9a65913b384c7a7&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\"><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/xPnVKczjwZKcRaCNsibM4ticpkVlJsqVyOVPEHhicqslo00wlWjE7aEZedYlqBW9OoX14J6JzgB3L1CCetp2lkafzd3ofnVIBxxZ8l67dKXv6g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></a><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3Mzg5MDQzMQ=